"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\"id\":\"msg_01QFdKZhPLeiqHtSsMbd1xM9\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_019DccXMjoaUDWG29dDBVNyn\",\"name\":\"Read\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/Users/alyshialedlie/code/ISPublicSites/tcad-scraper/server/src/__tests__/README.md\"}}],\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":3,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":46946,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":46946,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":102,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CVX7HoyBMHx316N2A5Qa5\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"175833ba-2832-4b8c-a704-3814b72c6e1d\",\"timestamp\":\"2025-11-26T20:11:13.059Z\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"175833ba-2832-4b8c-a704-3814b72c6e1d\",\"isSidechain\":false,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/alyshialedlie/code/ISPublicSites/tcad-scraper\",\"sessionId\":\"25bccdbf-80b7-4cab-bbc2-e54d27141927\",\"version\":\"2.0.31\",\"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_019DccXMjoaUDWG29dDBVNyn\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"     1→# Test Suite Organization\\n     2→\\n     3→This directory contains both **unit tests** and **integration tests** for the TCAD Scraper backend.\\n     4→\\n     5→## Test Structure\\n     6→\\n     7→```\\n     8→src/\\n     9→├── __tests__/\\n    10→│   ├── *.test.ts              # Unit tests (mocked, fast)\\n    11→│   ├── *.integration.test.ts  # Integration tests (real services)\\n    12→│   ├── setup.ts               # Test environment setup\\n    13→│   └── README.md              # This file\\n    14→├── controllers/__tests__/\\n    15→├── lib/__tests__/\\n    16→├── middleware/__tests__/\\n    17→├── routes/__tests__/\\n    18→├── services/__tests__/\\n    19→├── utils/__tests__/\\n    20→└── .../__tests__/\\n    21→```\\n    22→\\n    23→## Unit Tests vs Integration Tests\\n    24→\\n    25→### Unit Tests (`*.test.ts`)\\n    26→\\n    27→**Purpose**: Test individual components in isolation with mocked dependencies\\n    28→\\n    29→**Characteristics**:\\n    30→- Fast execution (< 10 seconds)\\n    31→- No external service dependencies\\n    32→- All database/Redis/API calls are mocked\\n    33→- Run in parallel\\n    34→- Suitable for CI/CD pipelines\\n    35→\\n    36→**Configuration**: `vitest.config.ts`\\n    37→\\n    38→**Run with**:\\n    39→```bash\\n    40→npm test              # Run all unit tests\\n    41→npm run test:watch    # Watch mode\\n    42→npm run test:coverage # With coverage report\\n    43→```\\n    44→\\n    45→**Excluded from unit tests**:\\n    46→- `*.integration.test.ts`\\n    47→- `src/__tests__/integration.test.ts`\\n    48→- `src/__tests__/api.test.ts`\\n    49→- `src/__tests__/auth-database.connection.test.ts`\\n    50→- `src/__tests__/enqueue.test.ts`\\n    51→- `src/__tests__/security.test.ts`\\n    52→\\n    53→### Integration Tests (`*.integration.test.ts`)\\n    54→\\n    55→**Purpose**: Test complete workflows with real services\\n    56→\\n    57→**Characteristics**:\\n    58→- Longer execution time (up to 60 seconds per test)\\n    59→- Requires external services (PostgreSQL, Redis)\\n    60→- Tests actual API endpoints\\n    61→- Runs sequentially to avoid conflicts\\n    62→- Retries once on failure\\n    63→\\n    64→**Configuration**: `vitest.integration.config.ts`\\n    65→\\n    66→**Prerequisites**:\\n    67→- ✅ **Tailscale VPN** must be running (`tailscale status`)\\n    68→- ✅ **PostgreSQL** database accessible via Tailscale\\n    69→- ✅ **Redis** must be running (local or hobbes)\\n    70→- ✅ **DATABASE_URL** configured in environment\\n    71→\\n    72→**Run with**:\\n    73→```bash\\n    74→npm run test:integration              # Run all integration tests\\n    75→npm run test:integration:watch        # Watch mode\\n    76→npm run test:auth-db                  # Auth-database tests only\\n    77→npm run test:auth-db:connection       # Connection test only\\n    78→npm run test:enqueue                  # Queue enqueue test only\\n    79→```\\n    80→\\n    81→## Test Files by Category\\n    82→\\n    83→### Unit Tests (22 files, 282 tests)\\n    84→\\n    85→**Middleware**:\\n    86→- `middleware/__tests__/auth.test.ts` - JWT authentication\\n    87→- `middleware/__tests__/error.middleware.test.ts` - Error handling\\n    88→- `middleware/__tests__/metrics.middleware"
